{"data":{"id":9546,"title":"Bài tập 2: Chuyển đổi ProductServiceClientRT sang FeignClient","description":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:18pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài tập 2: Chuyển đổi ProductServiceClientRT sang FeignClient</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Cấp độ: Vận dụng cơ bản/chuyên sâu</strong></span></i></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1. Mục tiêu kiến thức</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thực hành chuyển đổi từ cách gọi imperative (RestTemplate) sang declarative (FeignClient), đồng thời cấu hình FallbackFactory xử lý lỗi đầy đủ.</span></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>2. Tình huống nghiệp vụ</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sau khi sửa xong ProductServiceClientRT ở Bài tập 1, đội trưởng yêu cầu chuyển sang FeignClient để đồng bộ với phong cách code của cả team. Ngoài ra, cần bổ sung thêm UserClient để order-service lấy thông tin người mua. Lớp RestTemplate cũ (đã đúng từ Bài tập 1) có code như sau để tham khảo:</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"table\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-style:none;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\" width=\"576\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt;\"><td style=\"background-color:#f3f3f3;overflow-wrap:break-word;overflow:hidden;padding:0pt 5.75pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">// ProductServiceClientRT.java (đã đúng từ Bài tập 1 — chỉ để tham khảo)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">@Component</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">public class ProductServiceClientRT {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;private final RestTemplate restTemplate;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;public ProductServiceClientRT(@LoadBalanced RestTemplate restTemplate) {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;this.restTemplate = restTemplate;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;public ProductInfo getById(Long id) {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;try {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return restTemplate.getForObject(</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"http://product-service/api/products/{id}\", ProductInfo.class, id);</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;} catch (ResourceAccessException e) {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return ProductInfo.fallback(id);</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;} catch (HttpClientErrorException.NotFound e) {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;throw new ProductNotFoundException(id);</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// getAll() cung toan cach tuong tu...</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">}</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>3. Yêu cầu của bài tập</strong></span></span></h1><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tạo interface ProductClient với @FeignClient(name=\"product-service\") thay thế hoàn toàn lớp ProductServiceClientRT, khai báo đầy đủ hai phương thức: getById(Long id) và getAll().</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tạo interface UserClient với @FeignClient(name=\"user-service\"), khai báo phương thức getUserById(Long userId) trả về UserInfo.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Viết ProductClientFallbackFactory cài đặt đầy đủ: log exception, trả fallback cho getById(), trả danh sách rỗng cho getAll().</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">So sánh số dòng code của ProductServiceClientRT (RestTemplate) và ProductClient (FeignClient) trong báo cáo. Lập luận khi nào mỗi cách phù hợp hơn dựa trên bài học.</span></span></li></ul><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>4. Kết quả mong muốn</strong></span></span></h1><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ProductClient và UserClient khai báo đúng, không có implementation class.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">FallbackFactory log được exception và trả về đúng giá trị dự phòng.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Báo cáo so sánh code rõ ràng, có lập luận về khi nào dùng mỗi cách.</span></span></li></ul><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>5. Hướng dẫn nộp bài</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nộp Git repository chứa mã nguồn order-service đã cập nhật và báo cáo so sánh (.docx/.pdf). README.md mô tả cách chạy thử.</span></span><br>&nbsp;</p>","createdBy":"49","createdAt":"2026-07-14T01:46:20.000Z","updatedAt":null,"updatedBy":null,"status":1,"position":7110,"tutorial":"","gradingCriteria":"# Tiêu chí chấm điểm — Bài tập 2: Chuyển đổi ProductServiceClientRT sang FeignClient\n\n_Vận dụng cơ bản/chuyên sâu | Thang điểm: 100_\n\n| Tiêu chí | Mô tả chi tiết | Điểm |\n|---|---|---|\n| ProductClient đúng cú pháp | Interface khai báo đúng, đủ hai phương thức, @FeignClient hợp lệ. | 25 |\n| UserClient đúng cú pháp | Interface UserClient khai báo đúng, đủ phương thức. | 20 |\n| FallbackFactory | Log exception, trả fallback đúng cho từng method. | 30 |\n| So sánh và lập luận | So sánh code rõ ràng, lập luận chọn RestTemplate vs Feign. | 25 |\n| **Tổng** | | **100** |","sampleLink":"","expectedTime":60},"statusCode":200}